  // DEPLOY STATUS:
  // ✅ Heaven source frozen in canonical repo
  // ✅ Heaven config upgraded to wrangler.jsonc
  // ✅ Worker deployed (heaven.rsp-5f3.workers.dev)
  // ✅ noizy.ai zone ACTIVE (nameservers delegated to marek/tara)
  // ✅ Observability enabled @ 100% sampling
  // ✅ AI Bots blocked, DNSSEC pending, HSTS active
  // ☐ Custom domain active (heaven.noizy.ai) — uncomment routes below
